msgid "The store has no llms.txt file"
msgstr "Sklep nie ma pliku llms.txt"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-site-health.php:134
msgid "llms.txt describes your store and products for AI assistants in one tidy file. Turn on \"Serve /llms.txt\" in WooCommerce → FeedTrix → Settings."
msgstr "llms.txt opisuje sklep i produkty dla asystentów AI w jednym uporządkowanym pliku. Włącz „Serwuj /llms.txt” w WooCommerce → FeedTrix → Ustawienia."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-site-health.php:135
#: includes/class-feedtrix-site-health.php:150
